          "text": "NVIDIA NemotronLabs RE-USE is on ModelScope: a 9.6M-parameter speech restoration model for noise, reverb, clipping, codec artifacts, packet loss, and low-quality microphones.\n🤖 https://t.co/DKZg879lCu\n\n🎧 Broad audio support: Handles mono audio from 8–48 kHz, with optional https://t.co/tyvIKjrDRG",
