            "quote_count": 0,
            "reply_count": 0,
            "retweet_count": 0
          },
          "text": "60 new AI models in two months. Only 4 came from Chinese labs.\n\nThis is a Release Intensity Calendar for September and October 2026. Each square is one day, and the number in it is how many notable AI models were released that day, as logged in Epoch AI's public AI Models https://t.co/daz7V8i0bq",
          "url": "https://x.com/Heinric98694776/status/2117553208990093413"
