          },
          "text": "Just wanted to share a (very much WIP) little side project of mine showcasing the benefits/speed of @googlegemma  DiffusionGemma 🙂 (text diffusion model)\nProject is called “DiffusionGearvis” (mix between DiffusionGemma and Jarvis, IronMan’s AI assistant) and I wanted to https://t.co/xwmRsTrFkx",
          "url": "https://x.com/JamesAssiene/status/2117455339071168766"
