            "reply_count": 0,
            "retweet_count": 0
          },
          "text": "Morning Ai News (Tuesday)\n\nHere’s the full picture for Tuesday, November 3.\n\n**Anthropic S-1 and RSI**  \nAnthropic’s amended S-1 shows roughly $17B in Q3 revenue (up sharply year-over-year) against a large quarterly loss and about $895B in compute commitments. The filing adds",
          "url": "https://x.com/JamesDelotis/status/2117572130397155835"
        },
        {
          "author_id": "2051561124756393984",
          "created_at": "2026-11-03T09:26:00.000Z",
          "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
            "2117548840073199844"
