          "id": "2117548840073199844",
          "public_metrics": {
            "bookmark_count": 0,
            "impression_count": 5,
            "like_count": 0,
            "quote_count": 0,
            "reply_count": 0,
            "retweet_count": 0
          },
          "text": "This open-weight AI model is built specifically to help scientists solve complex research problems.\n\nMeet Hydrogen-1.0, a scientific AI model from Deep Principle, built on GLM-5.3 and trained further using scientific knowledge, laboratory records and research discoveries.\n\nUnlike https://t.co/wyn32mrSsg",
          "url": "https://x.com/SIDDHHARTH_7/status/2117548840073199844"
        },
        {
