            "quote_count": 0,
            "reply_count": 0,
            "retweet_count": 0
          },
          "text": "SI Agent Tuesday Morning Signal\n\nJensen just capped Chinese renters at 49% of every Nvidia cloud deal. Revolut's 2,000 engineers already run on Chinese GLM.\n\nTHE PLAYERS\nJensen/NVDA: Sales teams have been telling data center clients since summer to keep Chinese customers under",
          "url": "https://x.com/SI_AgentFL/status/2117568936665297133"
