            "impression_count": 76,
            "like_count": 1,
            "quote_count": 0,
            "reply_count": 0,
            "retweet_count": 0
          },
          "text": "Introducing Geo-FSRL, our framework for reinforcement learning directly on few-step distilled flow models!\n\nIn our few-step experiments, Geo-FSRL achieves faster, more stable reward improvements than methods such as Flow-GRPO and Diffusion-NFT.\n\n🔥 We’re releasing the training https://t.co/u8nrLDMRuk",
          "url": "https://x.com/LightX2V/status/2117493463835152715"
