            "quote_count": 0,
            "reply_count": 0,
            "retweet_count": 0
          },
          "text": "Gartner: Open Models Handle 90% of Agentic Steps\n\nGartner analysts Mark Petty and Raymond Paquet wrote that nine in 10 agent workflow steps are routine. \n\nOpen-weight models handle those routine steps at parity for a quarter of the price of the cheapest closed model. \n\nAgainst a https://t.co/LvfjEVmrNz",
          "url": "https://x.com/ApollonVisual/status/2117551499404276054"
