            "impression_count": 4,
            "like_count": 0,
            "quote_count": 0,
            "reply_count": 0,
            "retweet_count": 0
          },
          "text": "Mistral just released open weights for its 1-trillion-parameter model, Large 4 “Le Chonk”! 🐱\n\nIt leads open models on coding-agent tasks while using 47% fewer tokens. A major step for accessible, European-trained AI.\n\n#AI #Mistral #OpenSource #LeChonk https://t.co/nQVnDDWend",
          "url": "https://x.com/saikrishna__777/status/2117583702620270983"
        },
        {
