            "impression_count": 12,
            "like_count": 0,
            "quote_count": 0,
            "reply_count": 0,
            "retweet_count": 0
          },
          "text": "GLOBAL ACCESSIBILITY WITH THE https://t.co/SBrDSky0eM ANDROID APP\n\n\"AI at your fingertips wherever you go means your favorite development workspace should speak your language and run lightning fast.\"\n\nModern software engineering demands absolute flexibility. Whether you are https://t.co/7YcDH2iGeW",
          "url": "https://x.com/Happy_hillman/status/2117603984122982824"
        },
        {
