          },
          "text": "Mistral just dropped open weights for Large 4: 1T params, ~52B active, multimodal in, text + code out.\n\nA frontier-scale model you can actually self-host (on 4 B200s, so not your laptop). Open weights keep pressuring closed APIs on price.\n\nhttps://t.co/gUeFyZGrNk",
          "url": "https://x.com/montiusAI/status/2117481903595118800"
        },
        {
