          "text": "i think this is how all of these open weights models were made. no training, no distillation, they just asked gpt or opus to edit the weights directly. \n\nif you pay attention, open weights models always get released right after a new anthropic or openai model comes out. https://t.co/Q2ZxYfQRnE",
