          "text": "MIT just showed GPT-6 can rewrite another AI's weights in plain English. No retraining, no gradient descent, 40 points on math. It rewired Qwen, an open-weights model. Machines editing machines is the singularity. Open weights spread it faster than Washington can regulate it.",
          "url": "https://x.com/Gnaritas91/status/2117489239395008539"
