          },
          "text": "Mistral Large 4 is now open weight, and the number I care about isn't the score.\n\nPer Mistral, it ties the top open model on the Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index while using 47% fewer tokens per task.\n\nFor agents, tokens per task is the real bill.\nhttps://t.co/FIhRzUQDrD",
