          },
          "text": "OpenAI and Anthropic want to sell you intelligence by subscription. Open-source AI is making ownership a viable alternative.\n\nThe most consequential development in AI isn't another proprietary frontier model. It's the convergence of powerful open-weight models, autonomous https://t.co/eKei3Bf9ew https://t.co/C3PjmjPZFm",
