          "text": "\"Harness\" — the scaffolding that turns a model into an agent — is suddenly a trending search among ordinary Chinese internet users, right next to beginner tutorials for DeepSeek agents.\n\nTwo years ago we argued about which model was smartest. Now we argue about plumbing.\n\nThe",
