          "text": "I got DeepSeek V4.1 Flash running at ~1000 tok/s.\n\nSame open weights, served on our own GPUs.\nThat's ~3x faster than DeepSeek's own API.\n\nWhy it matters:\n- coding agents stop making you wait between steps\n- a 3k-token answer lands in a few seconds, not ten\n- long agent loops and https://t.co/EoDap6Agoz",
